                        WSAG Meetings Minutes, Originals,
                    1969–1970. Top Secret. The meeting took place in the Situation Room of the White
                    House.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d81-f2" n="2" xml:id="d81-f2-content">
                <p>The Department of Defense study entitled, “Indochina Contingencies, Dry Season,
                    1970–1971,” dated November 30. (Ibid., RG 59,
                    Central Files 1970–73, POL 1–1 ASIA SE)</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
